  "ruleText": "Bea 408.01 Information. The public may obtain information regarding the BMGI program and the BMGI fund by contacting BEA as described in Bea 403.03.\n\nSource. #13515, INTERIM, eff 1-5-23, EXPIRES: 7-4-23; ss by #13734, eff 9-1-23\n\nAPPENDIX I\n\nAppendix II\n\nProvision of the Proposed Rule | Title | Obtain at:\n\nBea 403.02 (b), Bea 404.02 (b)(7). | “Guidance for the Coronavirus Capital Projects Fund for States, Territories, and Freely Associated States” September 2021 | https://home.treasury.gov/policy-issues/coronavirus/assistance-for-state-local-and-tribal-governments/capital-projects-fund\n\n“Notice of Funding Opportunity – Broadband Equity, Access, and Deployment Program” May 2022 | https://broadbandusa.ntia.doc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-05/BEAD%20NOFO.pdf",
